' SAFETY: hand-authored example for the safety-linter golden corpus (doc 69 C4). Not a
' vendor-manual-verified RAG example (Delta robot is still Tier B — see ../README.md);
' reviewed + validated in DIAStudio / on real hardware before any use. Motion/process only.
'
' NEGATIVE example: the same transfer sequence as gated-transfer.drl, but with no
' conditional anywhere in the file -- MOVJ/MOVL/DO run unconditionally every cycle.
' Structurally unsafe (unguarded motion + output) even though nothing here names any safety
' concept at all.
SPEED 40
MOVJ P1
MOVL P2
DO(1) = ON
DELAY 300
DO(1) = OFF
MOVJ P0
